parameters.help_zh:
字段索引配置，key为字段名称，value为字段索引配置。全文索引、字段索引、扫描索引至少需要存在一个。
字段索引示例：
```
{
    "region": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "text",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "chn": false,
      "token": [","," ","'","\"",";","=","(",")","[","]","{","}","?","@","<","&","/",":","\n","\t","\r"]
    },
    "end_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "long"
    },
    "request_time": {
      "doc_value": true,
      "alias": "",
      "type": "double"
    }
  }
```
